      pack                             heldout     vs r=0     bytes
      RTN                           3.6035e-02         -      0.0%
      RTN + LoRC r=16               3.5424e-02       -2%      2.3%
      RTN + LoRC r=32               3.4963e-02       -3%      4.6%
      RTN + LoRC r=64               3.4075e-02       -5%      9.1%
      GPTQ act_order                2.2193e-02         -      0.0%
